  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Set aside to slightly cool. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-5b8feafd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate zucchini and carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture with a paper towel.\n• Thinly slice spring onion. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the veggies will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-ddd296c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine zucchini, carrot, spring onion, shredded Cheddar cheese, the plain flour, vegetable stock pot and the egg.\n• Add the salt and a pinch of pepper and chilli flakes (if using). Mix well. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-f85b0508.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person. TIP: Add extra olive oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-51cd2105.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fritters are cooking, combine the honey with a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl.\n• Season, then add mixed salad leaves, pepitas and the slightly cooled roast veggies.\n• Gently toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-7b4386ef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide zucchini, carrot and Cheddar fritters and roast veggie salad between plates.\n• Serve with babaganoush. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634501ea6fa348d9bd0bf2e3/step-7bffaca8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
